      "id": "jacobian_determinant",
      "name": "雅可比行列式",
      "description": "Jacobi矩阵和Jacobi行列式的概念，变量变换（坐标变换）中的导数关系",
      "formulas": [
        "J=\\frac{\\partial(u,v)}{\\partial(x,y)}=\\begin{vmatrix}u_x&u_y\\\\v_x&v_y\\end{vmatrix}",
